const rawContentHtml = "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Part 23, the Lady and the Warrior await our challenge!\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Sanctuary\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sanctuary</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#The_Lady&#39;s_Lesson\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Lady's Lesson</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Highway_to_Hell\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Highway to Hell</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#The_Warrior&#39;s_Judgment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Warrior's Judgment</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sanctuary\">Sanctuary</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Sanctuary\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_23?action=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Sanctuary\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>You can do either of these two gateways in any order, but I'm going to do this one first since the other has a higher bonus line, so the game seems to say this one should be first. These two gateways are good warm-ups for the Chasm in the Rotting Land. Teleport to the Cavern of Earth teleport stone, this is where the Chasm in the Rotting Land is, but we're bypassing it. Follow the beach to a chest with a Crystal, around the other end we can see our destination gateway. Shatter the rock and grind to another Crystal, and to the left and behind the gateway are yet more Crystals. Finally, head inside.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><b>AC</b>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=201