f=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Delusory Knight\"><img alt=\"Delusory Knight\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Chain Skill\"><img alt=\"Chain Skill\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Shantotto needs more proof of our power, let's give it to her. The best way to chain enemies is a Cross Chain at F4 to get four, but our Assist is in the way, fight it if you want to clear it out. Be warned though, if you only have a Multichain left, save it for the next floor. I did, so I had to fight enemies one by one. If you do, be warned that the two emblems are a Physical Damage 0 and Magic Damage 0, swap party members accordingly.\n</p><p>The enemy guarding the chest is a Level 59 Delusory Knight. The enemy on H2 above is a Level 60 Transient Gunner. Third, a Level 62 Fallacious Wanderer. The last Hard enemy is a Level 63 Capricious Thief. The Expert piece is a Level 50 Horror of Antiquity, Prishe's manikin. She's pretty tough, a Hyper Ring with No BRV Damage and 8 HP = 100% boosters, and the Hecatoncheir summon. Once you turn off those boosters though she isn't too hard, though Prishe's fast attacks are annoying, her slow HP attacks and the Horror's lack of an Assist make it easy to avoid HP damage. Remember to use the crystal of the arena to help drain the enemy's Bravery. Defeating the Expert reveals the tile at B1 so we can reach the third chest.\n</p><p>The far right chest has a random chain skill - by pure luck, I got a Multichain. The cheat at A1 that the Expert guarded is a lame Valor Resin.\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"0